{
  "id": 274515430,
  "iid": 13988,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Set subdissector for SMS NAS messages in HTTP2",
  "description": "NAS messages within N1N2MessageTransfer with a Payload Type of SMS are not being decoded.  SMS NAS in these cases will be in the uplink direction.  Downlink messages to the SMSF are carried from the AMF in an UplinkSMS message, where decoding was added in !5944.\n\nDecoding of the SMS NAS messages can be enabled by setting the subdissector to `gsm_a_dtap_handle` where the n1_msg_class is SMS.\n\n[sms_cp-ack_in_http2.pcapng](/uploads/b3804386f78be794da6c57217f1dcae2/sms_cp-ack_in_http2.pcapng)",
