        {
          "id": 1722100184,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Sorry about that, I did indeed get my directions mixed up.  Uplink messages from the UE would be sent to the SMSF by the AMF in the UplinkSMS SBI message.\n\nI just wanted to address the comment that you had there to clear up if a consideration of direction was indeed required, that the NAS messages we would be decoding here would be those of the Downlink direction to the UE.",
          "author": {
            "id": 5925829,
            "username": "jmasterfunk",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Jeff Dyer",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
